
# ─── Regulus · commit template ────────────────────────────────────────────────
#
# type(scope): imperative subject, lowercase, no trailing period, ≤72 chars
#
# Blank line, then the WHY. The what is already in the diff.
# Which decision was made, which alternative was discarded, which doc mandates it.
#
# Footers (optional, one per line):
#   Refs: docs/05-roadmap.md §2       ← which phase or decision this advances
#   Closes: #12
#   Co-Authored-By: Name <email>       ← agents sign their own work
#   BREAKING CHANGE: what breaks and how to migrate   ← required with `!`
#
# types:  feat fix docs refactor perf test build ci chore revert style
# scopes: core proto cli gui modules store bus terminal acp mcp docs assets
#         design repo ci deps hooks
#
# Commits are in English (decision #20). Full rules: docs/09-git.md · config: .gitconventions
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
